<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/8/eng@/~cl_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/8/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 16 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “(aa) for regulating and prescribing the procedure and the practice to be followed in the High Court, the Court of Appeal and the Federal Court in all causes and matters whatsoever in or with respect to the hearing of any matter or proceeding through a remote communication technology;”. Amendment of section 17"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/8/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/8/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/8/eng@> .
